WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.965
A pharmacy visit can happen one small step at a time. You can ask questions.

2
00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:10.256
Bring a prescription or note if you have one. If not, you can still ask for help.

3
00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:15.612
Tell the pharmacist what you came to collect or ask about. A written note is okay.

4
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:20.708
Wait somewhere comfortable. You can ask how long it may take, or where to sit.

5
00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:26.326
Ask the pharmacist to explain the label in plain words. You can ask them to repeat it.

6
00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:31.813
Before you leave, check your items. Take your time or ask someone you trust to help.

7
00:00:31.813 --> 00:00:38.800
You are allowed to ask questions. Pause and ask a pharmacist if anything is unclear.
